  "id": "cboettig/gbif",
  "title": "H3-Indexed cloud-optimized snapshots of GBIF ",
  "description": "Processed GBIF occurrence records (3.57 billion, from the 2026-09-01 snapshot) with valid coordinates, deduplicated and partitioned by H3 resolution-0 cell with H3 indices at resolutions 0-10. Includes derived products: per-hexagon taxonomic counts, a join of occurrences with US historical redlining (Mapping Inequality) polygons, and a reference taxa list.",
  "keywords": [
    "biodiversity",
    "h3",
    "geoparquet",
    "global-coverage",
    "ecology",
    "species-classification",
    "taxonomy",
    "species-occurrences"
  ],
